# approvals' queue routes on an email item (core/modules/approvals/README.md "Routes"; gamma-p4-090):
# a member's session, approvals.decide; only the owner of an email item's mailbox decides it. Both
# POSTs are @Idempotent(): the Idempotency-Key is an example UUID; the same key answers the first
# press again. A write sends the cookie, so it sends Origin: {{appOrigin}} too. `emailItemId` is a
# pending email item of your workspace and `draftId` the draft its row showed (GET …/items, the
# item's `draft.id`): put both in http-client.private.env.json with your workspaceId.

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/approvals/items/{id}/approve: approves a first email with the subject and body given, frozen and hashed together, for the draft shown; 200 with the item; 403 not_sender_owner, 400 draft_text_refused with details.issues or draft_subject_not_allowed for a follow-up, 409 approval_draft_changed, approval_item_not_pending or approval_draft_pending
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/approvals/items/{{emailItemId}}/approve
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000004090

{
  "subject": "Warm leads at Acme",
  "text": "Ines, how does your team follow up on warm leads today? A short question about it.",
  "draftId": "{{draftId}}"
}

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/approvals/items/{id}/approve: a draftId that is not the item's draft, as from a stale screen; 409 approval_draft_changed, nothing approved
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/approvals/items/{{emailItemId}}/approve
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000004091

{ "draftId": "mdr_not_this_items" }

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/approvals/items/{id}/skip: skips the email item, its draft left as it is; 200 with the item; 403 not_sender_owner, 409 approval_item_not_pending, 404 approval_item_not_found
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/approvals/items/{{emailItemId}}/skip
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000004092
